---
import ApplicationLayout from "../layouts/ApplicationLayout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---

<ApplicationLayout
  current="today"
  description="Your protected Kinship Today workspace."
  pageId="app.today"
  title="Today — Kinship"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="page-frame" tabindex="-1">
    <header class="page-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Today · <span data-workspace-name></span></p>
        <h1 id="today-heading">Opening your workspace…</h1>
        <time data-today-date></time>
      </div>
      <p class="honesty-note">Due tasks are available now. Reminders, cadence, and the complete attention ordering remain in their accepted delivery leaves.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="today-section attention-section" aria-labelledby="attention-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">First success</p>
          <h2 id="attention-heading">Needs attention</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="state-badge">Getting started</span>
      </div>
      <p>Build the context that will make Kinship useful. Complete these three steps in order:</p>
      <ol class="success-loop">
        <li><strong>Add a person or start an import.</strong><span>People creation and import arrive in their cataloged delivery slices.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Record the first interaction or note.</strong><span>Keep the context you want to remember.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Create a task, reminder, or stay-in-touch cadence.</strong><span>That work will later appear in the complete Today queue.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="projection-note">Task completion here uses the same planning action as the person and global task surfaces.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="today-section" aria-labelledby="reconnect-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="reconnect-heading">People to reconnect</h2><span class="state-badge calm">Not available yet</span></div>
      <p>Cadence-aware suggestions will appear after People and stay-in-touch behavior are delivered.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="today-section" aria-labelledby="upcoming-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="upcoming-heading">Upcoming tasks</h2><span class="state-badge calm">Next 30 days</span></div>
      <p id="today-tasks-state" class="section-state" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading due tasks…</p>
      <ul id="today-tasks-list" class="task-list" aria-label="Due tasks"></ul>
      <div class="form-actions"><button id="today-tasks-retry" class="button-secondary" type="button" hidden>Retry due tasks</button><a class="button-secondary" href="/app/tasks">Open all tasks</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="today-section" aria-labelledby="recent-people-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="recent-people-heading">Recently viewed people</h2><span class="state-badge calm">No people yet</span></div>
      <p>Recently opened people will appear here once the People workspace is available.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="today-favorite-notes-region" class="today-section" aria-labelledby="favorite-notes-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="favorite-notes-heading">Favorite notes</h2><span class="state-badge calm">Reference</span></div>
      <p id="today-favorite-notes-state" class="section-state" aria-live="polite">Loading favorite notes…</p>
      <ul id="today-favorite-notes" class="interaction-list" aria-label="Favorite notes"></ul>
      <button id="today-favorite-notes-retry" class="button-secondary" type="button" hidden>Retry favorite notes</button>
    </section>

    <section id="today-recent-activity-region" class="today-section" aria-labelledby="activity-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="activity-heading">Recent activity</h2><span class="state-badge calm">Latest 20</span></div>
      <p id="today-recent-activity-state" class="section-state" aria-live="polite">Loading recent activity…</p>
      <ul id="today-recent-activity" class="interaction-list" aria-label="Recent activities and notes"></ul>
      <button id="today-recent-activity-retry" class="button-secondary" type="button" hidden>Retry recent activity</button>
    </section>
  </main>
</ApplicationLayout>

<script>
  import { mountTodayInteractions } from "../lib/interactions.ts";
  import { mountTodayTasks } from "../lib/tasks.ts";
  void mountTodayInteractions();
  void mountTodayTasks();
</script>
